WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:12.495
Establishing Beth's school was a family affair.

2
00:00:13.355 --> 00:00:17.816
Father worked all day on the roof repairs while Jo and Mother took charge of the painting.

3
00:00:18.737 --> 00:00:24.538
John, on the days he didn't work, came to help with the floors, and Meg provided the refreshments

4
00:00:24.618 --> 00:00:26.739
while her babies entertained all the workers.

5
00:00:27.799 --> 00:00:30.720
Mr. Laurence, of course, was in charge of the entire project.

6
00:00:31.848 --> 00:00:36.890
The transformation of the old house was amazing, as each day, the place looked fresher and improved.

7
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:40.191
"Does anyone need a drink?"

8
00:00:40.611 --> 00:00:43.892
Meg called, holding up an inviting glass of cold juice.

9
00:00:43.912 --> 00:00:47.233
"I think we all do," stated Mr.

10
00:00:47.253 --> 00:00:50.134
Laurence as he motioned for everyone to take a break.

11
00:00:51.174 --> 00:00:56.036
While the workers were satisfying their thirst, a carriage slowly pulled up at the house.

12
00:00:57.596 --> 00:01:02.959
A tall, sturdy young man got out, then held out his hand to a stylishly dressed young lady.

13
00:01:04.219 --> 00:01:05.240
She kissed the young man.

14
00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:09.281
Then, looking at the crowd in front of the house, she yelled, "Mother!

15
00:01:09.822 --> 00:01:11.002
Father! Meg!

16
00:01:11.502 --> 00:01:12.983
Jo! It's me!"

17
00:01:13.003 --> 00:01:18.045
"Amy?" Mother called, not sure she could believe her eyes.

18
00:01:19.726 --> 00:01:21.727
Then she ran to meet her youngest daughter.

19
00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.608
She hadn't seen her in a year.

20
00:01:24.528 --> 00:01:29.931
Amy, too, lifted her skirts, and forgetting her ladylike manners, ran to embrace her dear mother.

21
00:01:29.951 --> 00:01:32.293
"I can't believe you're home!"

22
00:01:32.693 --> 00:01:35.555
cried Mother, showering Amy with hugs and kisses.

23
00:01:35.575 --> 00:01:41.118
"Laurie!" shouted Jo when she noticed him lingering awkwardly by the carriage.

24
00:01:42.238 --> 00:01:46.821
He lifted his head eagerly as he saw his best friend running toward him with outstretched arms.

25
00:01:47.702 --> 00:01:52.440
Giving her a big hug, Laurie said, "It's so good to see you, Jo."

26
00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:58.602
"I'm so happy to see you, Laurie," replied Jo, "even though your dashing clothes are now covered in

27
00:01:58.642 --> 00:02:04.483
paint." Laughing, he said, "I don't think my wife will object under the circumstances."

28
00:02:04.503 --> 00:02:06.164
"Your wife?"

29
00:02:06.604 --> 00:02:07.484
Jo asked, stunned.

30
00:02:08.485 --> 00:02:13.566
Amy walked over to Laurie and waited till the others had caught up before announcing, "We got married

31
00:02:13.626 --> 00:02:14.746
in Italy last week."

32
00:02:16.327 --> 00:02:22.892
For a moment, no one said a word until Jo, recovering from the shock first, congratulated them sincerely.

33
00:02:22.912 --> 00:02:25.533
"I'm so happy for you both!"

34
00:02:25.833 --> 00:02:28.134
she said, her voice choked with emotion.

35
00:02:28.154 --> 00:02:33.075
"Thank you, Jo," Amy said warmly as she looked deeply into her sister's eyes.

36
00:02:33.095 --> 00:02:39.757
"Not only do I have my sister back," said Jo, taking their hands, "but now I have a

37
00:02:39.837 --> 00:02:40.457
new brother.

38
00:02:40.477 --> 00:02:42.218
I'm so pleased."

39
00:02:43.438 --> 00:02:48.059
Soon everyone joined in congratulating the newly married couple, until Mr.

40
00:02:48.119 --> 00:02:52.425
Laurence decided to call it a day and invited everyone to his home to celebrate.

41
00:02:53.886 --> 00:02:58.848
While Amy rode back with Mother, Meg, and the babies, Laurie decided to walk back with Jo.

42
00:02:58.868 --> 00:03:04.830
"I have so much to say, but I don't know how," Laurie said to Jo.

43
00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:08.691
"Then you don't need to say it," Jo replied.

44
00:03:08.711 --> 00:03:12.993
"We mustn't be burdened by the past but look forward to what lies ahead."

45
00:03:13.013 --> 00:03:16.595
"I'll always love you, you know," said Laurie.

46
00:03:17.175 --> 00:03:19.896
"But it's a different love than the kind I feel for Amy."

47
00:03:20.652 --> 00:03:24.815
"And you will always be my dear boy, my best friend," said Jo.

48
00:03:24.835 --> 00:03:26.756
"I will always love you."

49
00:03:28.217 --> 00:03:33.600
Jo and Laurie found great peace knowing that despite the bumpy road, their friendship had survived.

50
00:03:34.481 --> 00:03:36.702
At the Laurences' a feast was under way.

51
00:03:37.523 --> 00:03:41.645
Mr. Laurence wanted to know why Laurie and Amy had gotten married so quickly.

52
00:03:42.286 --> 00:03:45.968
More importantly, he wondered why they chose to do so in Italy.

53
00:03:47.284 --> 00:03:51.246
"France would have been a more romantic location, I should think," Mr.

54
00:03:51.266 --> 00:03:52.427
Laurence said with regret.

55
00:03:53.227 --> 00:03:58.250
Jo watched Amy place her hand on Laurie's as he tried to answer his grandfather's questions.

56
00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:03.293
"What a lovely couple they make," Jo thought, and she truly meant it.

57
00:04:04.013 --> 00:04:05.834
Suddenly, the servant announced to Mr.

58
00:04:05.854 --> 00:04:07.595
Laurence, "We have a visitor, sir."

59
00:04:07.615 --> 00:04:09.616
"A visitor?"

60
00:04:09.936 --> 00:04:11.197
Mr. Laurence looked around.

61
00:04:11.217 --> 00:04:14.579
"We're not expecting someone else, are we?"

62
00:04:14.599 --> 00:04:19.334
"The gentleman says he is a friend of Miss Jo's," the servant continued.

63
00:04:19.354 --> 00:04:21.156
"A friend of mine?"

64
00:04:21.476 --> 00:04:22.837
Jo repeated as she stood up.

65
00:04:22.857 --> 00:04:26.000
"Then show him in, by all means," said Mr.

66
00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:35.087
Laurence. To Jo's complete surprise, the Professor walked in, holding his hat nervously in his hand but with

67
00:04:35.127 --> 00:04:36.629
his head held up with dignity.

68
00:04:36.649 --> 00:04:38.490
"Professor Bauer!

69
00:04:38.971 --> 00:04:43.074
Fritz!" Jo shouted, her voice giving away her delight in seeing him.

70
00:04:43.094 --> 00:04:45.652
"Oh, Miss Jo."

71
00:04:45.672 --> 00:04:48.834
His features softened as he recognized a familiar face.

72
00:04:48.854 --> 00:04:53.677
"I apologize for the unannounced visit but it is a long story."

73
00:04:54.998 --> 00:04:57.520
"No need to explain," Jo said happily.

74
00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:02.343
"Everyone, this is Professor Friedrich Bauer, my dear friend from New York."

75
00:05:03.264 --> 00:05:08.507
No other words were necessary for once they heard who he was, the Professor was welcomed like a

76
00:05:08.587 --> 00:05:09.268
family member.

77
00:05:10.048 --> 00:05:14.651
Jo made space for him at the table and soon they were all laughing and talking like old

78
00:05:14.712 --> 00:05:17.761
friends. "Where are you staying, Professor?"

79
00:05:18.061 --> 00:05:18.541
asked Mr.

80
00:05:18.561 --> 00:05:23.023
Laurence. When the Professor named a local hotel in town, Mr.

81
00:05:23.063 --> 00:05:26.664
Laurence shook his head and said, "That won't do at all.

82
00:05:27.044 --> 00:05:28.505
You must be my guest here."

83
00:05:29.645 --> 00:05:34.227
Then he rang for his servant to collect the Professor's belongings and bring them to the mansion.

84
00:05:35.728 --> 00:05:41.730
Jo still could not believe how easily the Professor blended in with her family and friends, sitting at

85
00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:45.992
the same table and telling jokes and stories as if he had known them all his life.

86
00:05:46.952 --> 00:05:48.093
"Jo?" Mr.

87
00:05:48.113 --> 00:05:50.153
Laurence had to call twice to get her attention.

88
00:05:50.173 --> 00:05:53.675
"Jo?" "Oh, sorry," Jo said.

89
00:05:53.695 --> 00:05:55.035
"I didn't hear you."

90
00:05:55.055 --> 00:06:00.198
"Would you mind taking Professor Bauer to see the school tomorrow morning?

91
00:06:01.118 --> 00:06:05.420
I've formally asked him to become the headmaster but he hasn't given me his answer.

92
00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.641
Make sure you get it from him tomorrow," Mr.

93
00:06:08.661 --> 00:06:09.682
Laurence said with a wink.

94
00:06:11.322 --> 00:06:15.144
Smiling at him, Jo said she would be more than happy to do that.

95
00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:22.842
The next morning, true to her word, Jo escorted the Professor to the school site, asking him along

96
00:06:22.882 --> 00:06:24.442
the way about his life in New York.

97
00:06:25.122 --> 00:06:27.203
"Never mind me, Jo," he said.

98
00:06:27.223 --> 00:06:29.143
"I am more concerned about you.

99
00:06:30.064 --> 00:06:32.644
How are you coping with the loss of your dear sister?"

100
00:06:33.925 --> 00:06:39.566
As it always was with the Professor, Jo felt safe and secure showing him her deepest feelings.

101
00:06:40.746 --> 00:06:45.908
By the time they reached the school, the Professor had already offered his warm words of encouragement and

102
00:06:45.968 --> 00:06:47.412
hope to Jo.

103
00:06:47.432 --> 00:06:51.755
"Well, here we are," Jo said as she stepped back for him to view the school.

104
00:06:52.416 --> 00:06:56.358
"It doesn't look like much yet, but we hope to open it by the next school year."

105
00:06:56.378 --> 00:07:03.183
"It exceeds all my expectations," the Professor said, his eyes watering with emotion.

106
00:07:03.203 --> 00:07:09.628
"It will be smaller classes, but the school promises to look after the individual needs and talents of

107
00:07:09.688 --> 00:07:11.989
each student," Jo went on to explain.

108
00:07:12.009 --> 00:07:15.592
"As all good schools should," the Professor agreed.

109
00:07:17.104 --> 00:07:17.584
"As Mr.

110
00:07:17.624 --> 00:07:23.107
Laurence mentioned last night, he is eager for you to become the headmaster of the school," Jo said.

111
00:07:23.127 --> 00:07:24.307
"And you?"

112
00:07:24.648 --> 00:07:25.708
the Professor asked Jo.

113
00:07:25.728 --> 00:07:33.592
"I'm to be your assistant, organizing lessons, making sure the pupils are behaving, and mending socks," Jo said

114
00:07:33.632 --> 00:07:34.732
with a twinkle in her eye.

115
00:07:34.752 --> 00:07:40.755
"Then," the Professor said, puffing out his chest, "I will gladly accept."

116
00:07:41.475 --> 00:07:42.996
They shook hands wholeheartedly.
